"\n","Physical + temporal:\n","0.811922\n","\n","All features:\n","0.811989\n","\n","Conclusion:\n","Temporal history is overwhelmingly dominant.\n","Physical features provide a small but measurable improvement.\n","Availability indicators provide negligible additional benefit.\n","\n","\n","## CELL 12 — Main Error Findings\n","\n","Overall:\n","Speed RMSE = 5.222684\n","Flow RMSE = 413.518377\n","\n","By regime:\n","\n","R1:\n","Speed RMSE = 4.061436\n","Flow RMSE = 294.432456\n","\n","R2:\n","Speed RMSE = 4.298802\n","Flow RMSE = 323.953505\n","\n","R3:\n","Speed RMSE = 6.302603\n","Flow RMSE = 514.826909\n","\n","\n","## Critical Failure Mode\n","\n","Lag-1 available:\n","\n","Speed RMSE = 3.145628\n","Flow RMSE = 193.171128\n","\n","Lag-1 missing:\n","\n","Speed RMSE = 7.055457\n","Flow RMSE = 586.575199\n","\n","Therefore missing recent temporal history is the strongest identified failure mode.\n","\n","\n","## Traffic-State Failure\n","\n","Congested:\n","\n","Speed RMSE = 16.647867\n","Flow RMSE = 510.625322\n","\n","Free flow:\n","\n","Speed RMSE = 3.214202\n","Flow RMSE = 404.022489\n","\n","The model performs much worse during congestion.\n","\n","\n","## Important Worst-Case Pattern\n","\n","Several catastrophic predictions have:\n","\n","True speed ≈ 15–20 km/h\n","Predicted speed ≈ 115–122 km/h\n","\n","This means the model sometimes predicts free-flow traffic when the true state is severely congested.\n","\n","Repeated difficult links include:\n","- L405S-336\n","- L405S-254\n","- L405S-001\n","- L405S-124\n","- L405S-052\n","\n","\n","## Spatial Finding\n","\n","Direct observed-to-observed topology from the supplied topology file is sparse.\n","\n","Do NOT fabricate spatial neighbors using:\n","- row order\n","- link ID order\n","- order_index\n","\n","Spatial topology was therefore not used as a core feature.\n","\n","\n","## Temporal Finding\n","\n","Lag 1 is the strongest temporal feature.\n","\n","Temporal availability is limited because masked traffic history can itself be missing.\n","\n","Current feature construction was performed per daily masked file.\n","\n","Potential future investigation:\n","Carry legitimate temporal history across day boundaries instead of resetting lags at midnight.\n","\n","\n","## Validation Warning\n","\n","CELL 11 overall displayed scores were row-weighted.\n","Official Task 1 scoring averages regime scores.\n","\n","Future official-style evaluation should use:\n","mean(R1 score, R2 score, R3 score)\n","\n","Do not confuse row-weighted and regime-averaged scores.\n","\n","\n","## NEXT STEP\n","\n","Do NOT immediately perform blind hyperparameter tuning.\n","\n","First investigate:\n","\n","1. Why catastrophic congestion cases occur.\n","2. Whether lag-1 is missing in those cases.\n","3. What other lag/history information is available.\n","4. Whether cross-day temporal history can be carried safely.\n","5. Whether traffic-state/context features can identify congestion when recent history is unavailable.\n","6. Whether repeated difficult links have systematic behavior.\n","\n","Only after this investigation should model tuning or feature redesign be performed.\n","\n","\n","## Checkpoint Status\n","\n","Stage 3 Feature Engineering:\n","IN PROGRESS\n","\n","Cells 01–12:\n","COMPLETE\n","\n","Current best working model:\n","XGBoost\n","Physical + temporal features\n","\n","Next:\n","CELL 14 — Missing-History + Congestion Investigation\n","\"\"\"\n","\n","with open(\n","    CHECKPOINT_DIR / \"STAGE3_HANDOFF.md\",\n","    \"w\",\n","    encoding=\"utf-8\"\n",") as f:\n","    f.write(handoff)\n","\n","print(\"✓ Handoff document saved\")\n","\n","\n","# ------------------------------------------------------------\n","# 6. List checkpoint files and sizes\n","# ------------------------------------------------------------\n","\n","print(\"\\n\" + \"=\" * 80)\n","print(\"CHECKPOINT ARTIFACTS\")\n","print(\"=\" * 80)\n","\n","for path in sorted(CHECKPOINT_DIR.iterdir()):\n","    size_mb = 